# Task 2 – Color Classification

### Description

Classify the detected object using the following rules:

- R > G and R > B → RED
- G > R and G > B → GREEN
- B > R and B > G → BLUE

The detected color is printed to the serial monitor.

### File

- `Lab5_Task2.py`

---

# Task 3 – NeoPixel Control

### Description

The NeoPixel Ring automatically changes color based on the detected object.

| Detected Color | NeoPixel |
|---------------|----------|
| RED | Red |
| GREEN | Green |
| BLUE | Blue |

### File

- `Lab5_Task3.py`

