# Pin Connections

## TCS34725

| Sensor | ESP32 |
|---------|-------|
| SDA | GPIO21 |
| SCL | GPIO22 |
| VCC | 3.3V |
| GND | GND |

---

## NeoPixel Ring

| NeoPixel | ESP32 |
|-----------|-------|
| DIN | GPIO23 |
| VCC | 5V |
| GND | GND |

---

## Motor Driver (L298N)

| L298N | ESP32 |
|--------|-------|
| ENA | GPIO14 |
| IN1 | GPIO26 |
| IN2 | GPIO27 |

